 "comments": [
  {
   "id": "c_setup",
   "text": "Set up once: Last Stand's map pack (wave spawners, barricades, supply drops), knocked down instead of dead for defenders, the round table with tiers, turrets (2500, bots buy them too), bots fight the creatures, the armory. The mode's settings (This mode): rounds only end when the mode says, no team balance.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 2555
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 778,
    "h": 158
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_spawn",
   "text": "Everyone defends (a Terrorist is moved over) with an M4 and armor; the horde is creatures.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 3041,
    "y": 26
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2278,
    "h": 665
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_start",
   "text": "Each round is one stand: a message, then wave 1.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 254
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2278,
    "h": 224
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_waves",
   "text": "Waves: the round table plans each wave on the map's wave spawners (zombie-survival rounds: more and tougher each wave, new creature types, a baby garg at 7, bosses, packs, tiers, an alive cap). Hold out for 5. Between waves the fallen come back and everyone gets money.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 703
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3278,
    "h": 1094
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_deaths",
   "text": "Deaths: a defender who'd die is knocked down instead and bleeds out over 25 s (a teammate holding USE for 4 s gets them up: +200 for the helper); the base falls when no defender is standing; each creature killed pays what the round table says, and a point.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 1541,
    "y": 2106
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2278,
    "h": 607
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_shop",
   "text": "The armory: a real shop with a keeper at the map's Armory marker (else a defender spawn); walk up and press USE, or say !shop anywhere. It sells a turret kit (press USE where it should stand). Prices rise 5 % a wave; perks and the gun upgrade are on sale where the map has no machine or bench.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 2877
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3278,
    "h": 723
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c_ck",
   "text": "A creature killed: its pay goes to the killer, and a point.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 1820
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 1778,
    "h": 246
   }
  }
 ],
